slackresolve: slackresolve (ELF dependency resolver for Slackware)
slackresolve:
slackresolve: SlackResolve locates official Slackware packages that provide
slackresolve: missing files and ELF libraries. It can check an installed
slackresolve: program, search for a file, audit the system, or inspect packages
slackresolve: before installation. It recursively analyzes downloaded packages
slackresolve: and creates a reviewable plan for installpkg or upgradepkg.
slackresolve:
slackresolve: It uses slackpkg, pkgtools, readelf, and native Slackware package
slackresolve: records. Packages do not need embedded dependency metadata.
slackresolve: Homepage: https://github.com/garme/slackresolve
